      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. GET /api/contact\n provides the contact that has\n permision to be viewed across\n all profiles\n\n2. GET /api/porfile/:id\n\n Provides the information about\n specific id by performing if the \n authenticated user have \n permission to view it or not\n\n3. ",
      "fontSize": 27.191443957720736,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. GET /api/contact\n provides the contact that has\n permision to be viewed across\n all profiles\n\n2. GET /api/porfile/:id\n\n Provides the information about\n specific id by performing if the \n authenticated user have \n permission to view it or not\n\n3. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
