      "text": "1. POST /api/contact/connect/:userId\n\n Authenticated user can connect to the\n person whose its id it depends on id to \n accept it or not\n\n2. POST /api/conversation/approve/:conversationId\n\n Authenticated user who recieved a conversation request can approve\n the request and both party can start messsaging now\n\n without approval of conversation request no message can't be\n transferred \n\n3. DELETE /api/conversation/delete/:conversationId\n \n ",
